WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:02.810
My name is Kudou Taiki.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.920
I was taken to this place 
called the Digital World,

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.830
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.320
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.640
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.110
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.110
<b>Xros Heart (Team Taiki)  Team Blue Flare  Team Twilight</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.110
Protagonist                                         Rival

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.110
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.280
We managed to make Karatenmon laugh

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.890
and got the Shinobi Zone's 
symbol, the Code Crown.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.940
But the Monitamons' princess 
is still being held captive.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.380
We'll all work together to save her!

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:39.000
<b>The Underachieving Monitamons</b>

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:39.000
<b>Give It Their All!</b>

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:36.160
The Underachieving Monitamons 
Give It Their All!

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:56.110
Guess I was hearing things...

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.840
Attack the Monitamons' village at night!

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:03.970
At night?

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:06.940
Weren't we going to exchange the 
princess for the Code Crown?

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:10.110
I can't deal with such 
a tedious process!

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:14.070
Find whoever has it 
and take it by force!

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:14.790
Yes, sir!

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:17.620
I look forward to seeing how they panic.

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:31.000
So, it seems Mushamon's army 
is going to attack at night.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.320
Got it. Try to find where 
the princess is next.

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:40.300
If Shurimon's forces attack, 
we won't even be able to resist.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.110
What do we do, Taiki?

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.680
We'll hold the enemy here,

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.900
and save the princess in the meantime.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.810
So we split into two teams.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.160
Who will go after the princess?

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.960
This is my chance to 
show Nene what I can do!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.850
I'll go!

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:58.340
Huh?

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.190
We can't let Nene sneak into the castle

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:03.540
since she has the Code Crown.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:04.960
Zenjirou will do it.

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:06.710
Are you sure about that?

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:10.270
Zenjirou's been fighting 
with us all this time.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:10.980
He can do it.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.910
Yeah! Leave it to me!

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.380
Don't try it.

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.820
It's out of your league.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.120
I can do it!

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:19.920
Then take someone strong with you.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.990
Okay, Dorulumon, you go with him.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:22.850
What?

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.770
You'll have to sneak into the castle,

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.460
so we can't send a big group.

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:28.490
We can rely on you, Dorulumon.

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:31.660
Zenjirou and Dorulumon, 
you're the rescue team.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.030
Look what you got yourself into.

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:37.320
You can say that again. 
I'd be better off going alone.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.940
As the party leader,

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.640
I think we should bring 
an expert at infiltration.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.340
Monitamons, you come with us.

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:45.000
What? Us?

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.040
But we can't!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.450
It's your princess we're saving, right?

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.100
If you don't go,

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:53.760
we can't get information on the ones 
who have gone in before you.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.610
You must go so that we 
can maintain contact.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.480
Okay...

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.790
We understand, Elder.

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:01.990
Zenjirou, take the sword.

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:11.380
As long as I have a sword, I'll be fine.

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.900
I'm the number one swordsman 
in Koto, after all.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.010
Sparkle.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:15.840
Be careful.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:20.230
I will!

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:22.910
I'll take care of this, Nene!

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.220
Is he really gonna be okay?

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:27.940
We'll hold the enemy 
here as long as we can

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.910
while you rescue the princess.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:30.520
I'm counting on you.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.020
V!

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:53.680
We can see right through 
your little scheme!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.480
Hand over the Code Crown!

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.280
We'll never give it to you!

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:01.440
You are the team they 
call Xros Heart, correct?

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.720
A human has no right to speak!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.600
Think you can beat us humans?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.740
What?!

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.250
Stop running your mouth

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.160
and send forth the one 
who has the Code Crown!

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:13.530
That's me! I've got it!

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:20.540
Ow!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.700
According to the report 
from the Etemon troop,

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.880
we must make him laugh in 
order to claim the Code Crown.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.120
Make him laugh!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.060
Yes, sir!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:35.620
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.320
Stop! Stop it!

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.830
We're making him laugh, 
but it's not appearing!

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:42.650
He is not the one.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.720
Who has the Code Crown?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.700
Who could it be?

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.130
Men, attack them!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.340
We have to keep them 
here as long as we can.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.970
<b>Impmon</b>

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.970
<b>Attack: Pillar of Fire</b>

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.180
DigiMemory!

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.440
Impmon!

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.020
Pillar of Fire, activate!

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:17.130
Ah, that's hot!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:20.260
Rock Damashi!

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:23.840
Rinkazan!

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:38.730
There are guards at every gate.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.250
That much is to be expected.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.670
How do you intend to get inside?

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.700
Yes! We'll get in through that drain!

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.300
We're drowning!

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:02.660
What are you doing?!

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:05.680
I haven't mastered the 
art of water escape yet!

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.060
I failed the course, too!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:11.220
They all flunked?

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:14.000
Gah! Leg cramp!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.550
I-I'm drowning!

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:19.960
I'm glad I can count on these guys...

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:28.690
Okay, give me a visual of the castle.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:29.900
Roger!

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.710
That doesn't tell me anything...

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:35.610
I'm sorry.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:37.910
Let's just get above ground.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.690
Okay, come on up.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.920
I'm sure glad I can 
count on these guys...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.420
We're finally out...

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:25.370
We've found the princess!

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:28.330
She's been taken to the 
top floor of the castle keep!

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.760
Mushamon is right next door.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.580
So we'll have to climb up the castle keep,

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.580
distract Mushamon,

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.270
and get the princess out of there.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.950
Can we really do that?

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.630
If you're going to back out, 
this is the time.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:50.150
I'll do the rest myself.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.520
You're right. This is out of my league.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:54.940
I hate to admit it, but I 
can't save the princess...

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.240
Then I'll take it from here.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.830
Have you made it into the castle?

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.170
Well, not yet...

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:34.640
I'll do something about this guy!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.280
Knight!

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:53.410
Think you can evade my shuriken?

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.720
Sparrowmon!

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.990
Are you guys okay?

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:03.990
Zenjirou?

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:07.760
We're okay! Don't worry about us!

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:10.060
We believe in you!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.160
Taiki...

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.940
Taiki... everyone...

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.670
I will save the princess, 
no matter what.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.360
What?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.930
Didn't you say you couldn't do it?

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:57.370
No, I will!

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.500
I'll show you I can!

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:02.740
Intruders!

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.560
Fire Head!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:08.980
Chest!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.480
Chest!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.320
Chest!

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:20.190
You're not so helpless after all.

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:22.230
All right, let's climb the tower!

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:26.360
Then we will construct 
a kite you can ride on.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:28.350
What? A kite?

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:31.370
I'm not so good at 
dealing with heights...

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.540
Want to quit, then?

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:34.810
No! I'll do it!

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:52.760
I-I'm scared!

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.500
I'm going to do this!

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.570
Monitamons, huh?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.790
Śwabhojana!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.220
Oh, no!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.220
Drill Buster!

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.160
Did you get him?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:24.840
Yeah.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.990
All right, then send me up again!

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:28.590
Again?

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.840
After that blast, everyone in the 
castle will know we're here.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:31.540
It's dangerous!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.670
I know that!

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.330
Then why?

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:37.540
Because I'm a member of Xros Heart, too!

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:41.310
Taiki and the others are 
fighting with all they've got.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:43.240
So we have to do our part, too!

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:45.350
Master Zenjirou!

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:47.040
Everyone grab on to the kite!

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:47.780
What?!

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:49.520
Hurry up!

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:50.450
O-Okay!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.400
There they are!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.720
Get them!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:54.850
I'll take care of these guys.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:57.170
The rest is up to you, Zenjirou.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:58.820
Dorulumon...

00:12:58.820 --> 00:12:59.320
Go!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.160
Dorulu Tornado!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:15.710
Time to jump!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.780
Cherry Blossom Storm!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:29.370
Lion Dance!

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.470
It's just a little further to the princess!

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.490
So you're here.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:48.870
But this is as far as you go.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.170
Princess!

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:51.940
That's the princess?

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:55.490
I will not kill the princess before 
I obtain the Code Crown.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.580
But as for you...

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.370
Oh? It appears you have some 
knowledge of swordsmanship.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.150
The elites!

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:12.400
Are you all right, Princess?

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:13.460
Yes, I'm fine.

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:14.900
Get her out of here, quick!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.270
But...

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:16.800
Hurry!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:17.990
Thank you!

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.570
Sorry to take off first!

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.810
I won't let you escape!

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.360
I'm your opponent!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.830
You're in my way!

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.480
Do you think you are a match for me?

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:30.180
You guys get out of here, too!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.100
But...

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.460
We can't leave you here...

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:35.120
...by yourself!

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:49.700
Elder, we have secured the princess!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.400
All right! Great job!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:55.310
You mean this fight 
was just to buy time?!

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.710
But Master Zenjirou is 
still inside the castle!

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:01.870
What do you think you can do alone?!

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:04.980
I don't have strength like Taiki,

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:07.390
and I can't fight like the Digimon.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.720
Zenjirou...

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:11.160
But I know there's 
something even I can do!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.870
And that's fighting you, 
right here and now!

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:21.370
We must provide backup 
for Master Zenjirou!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.000
You guys...

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:29.390
Out of my way! Take that... and that!

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.630
Take that! And that!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.510
Monitamons...

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:35.890
We're with you!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:40.150
We're all with you, Master Zenjirou!

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:42.950
Take that!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.350
Kirisute Gomen!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.180
Monitamons!

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:00.920
Zenjirou!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:01.910
Nene!

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.180
Thank you.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:06.460
Now it's my turn to give it my best shot.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.020
My Xros Loader...

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:14.570
You're a true friend of Xros Heart now.

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.530
A friend...

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:22.180
Monitamons!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.100
DigiXros!

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:27.870
DigiXros!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:37.010
Hi-VisionMonitamon!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:41.100
Hellish Fire Shot!

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:44.550
Explosive Water Dragon!

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.150
Taiki!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.600
Zenjirou! You did great!

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.260
Leave the rest to us!

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:54.670
Yeah! I'm counting on you!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.730
Here!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.030
Perfect timing.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:59.830
I just took care of 
things on my side, too.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.110
All right, Taiki, let's do it!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:05.740
Yeah!

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:07.440
Storming Wind Wheel!

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:13.230
Why, you...

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.460
Shoutmon!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:32.330
Okay!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.040
Ballistamon!

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.320
Dorulumon!

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:41.310
Sparrowmon!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.010
Starmons!

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:45.950
Yes!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:49.090
DigiXros!

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:50.920
DigiXros!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.470
Shoutmon X5!

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:13.720
I'll slice you to pieces 
with my Hakuchoumaru!

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:15.860
Hakuchoumaru!

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:28.550
You dared to stall us while 
you snuck into the castle.

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:30.390
What a cunning trick!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:34.850
Kirisute Gomen!

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:37.010
Thunderous Lightning Flash!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.940
Meteor Buster Attack!

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:01.820
I truly thank you.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.420
We have safely recovered 
the princess and the castle.

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:07.770
Through this battle, we have also...

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:10.060
...gained new confidence!

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:12.220
Please allow us to accompany you.

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:13.460
Please!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:14.640
Sure.

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:17.320
You guys are part of Xros Heart now.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:20.590
Taiki, take them with you.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:24.730
They can maintain contact 
with my Monitamons.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.310
Okay.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.720
Hey, Taiki...

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:32.680
What?

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.650
I'll give this Code Crown to you.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.030
Nene...

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.070
I'm a member of Xros Heart now.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:48.700
But I still want to find my brother,

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.230
so I might not be able 
to help you all the time.

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:53.420
Of course, that's fine!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:57.010
Nene! I tried my hardest for you!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:01.740
I thought I had a better opinion 
of him after all he did, but now...

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:05.430
But isn't that one of the 
great things about Zenjirou?

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.800
What is?

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.190
When it counts, he can give 
his all for someone else.

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:11.800
He has decent faith in his allies, too.

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:14.720
Ah, Master Zenjirou,

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.300
the princess wishes to 
speak to you as well.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:22.170
It's not easy being a ladies' man...

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:25.000
For all you have done...

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:28.070
I thank you.

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:32.750
You're the princess?!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:33.800
Yes, my lord.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.140
L-Lord?!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:40.260
Master Zenjirou, please stay 
here in the castle with me!

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.830
I only have eyes for Nene!

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.080
Come back!

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.960
Give up on that "lord" stuff!

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:52.330
I'm not worthy of a princess!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.650
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:58.170
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:58.170
Digimon Data Collection!

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:02.110
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.110
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.110
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.110
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.110
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:14.530
<b>[Type]</b>

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:14.520
<b>Sea Animal Type</b>

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:14.530
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:14.510
<b>Marching Fishes</b>

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.520
Sesame is good for you!

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:17.520
Our DigiXros has dissolved!

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:18.920
Is it my fault?

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:22.810
You have neither the strength nor 
the spirit to help your friends.

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:26.100
This happened because 
I'm such a weakling...

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:27.130
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:29.350
<b>A Zone Collapses!</b>

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.400
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.350
<b>Sparks Fly Between Taiki and Kiriha!</b>
